content.text:
Now enhance 3D visuals. Let's modify drawBuilding to extrude and add ambient occlusion. Also add a subtle camera parallax? Could implement world as slightly perspective: not needed.

Let me rewrite drawBuilding with pseudo-3D. Current building front body at y+34 to y+h, roof gable. Add:
- Side face offset (12, 10): draw polygon (right wall) from right edge to offset.
- Roof depth: offset the roof ridge and eaves.

Could make it look more isometric. Let's create building function:

```
function drawBuilding(b){
 const x=b.x,y=b.y,w=b.w,h=b.h,d=14;
 // shadow
 shadow ellipse
 // side right dark
 ctx.fillStyle=shade(b.color,-25); path(x+w,y+34, x+w+d, y+34-d*0.55, x+w+d, y+h-d*0.55, x+w, y+h)
 // front wall
 body at x,y+34,w,h
 // stone base
 // windows with glow
 // door with frame + step
 // roof: two slope planes using offset
}
```
But buildings viewed top-down; side wall visible on right. Nice.

Roof: main gable facing viewer: triangle from left eave to ridge to right eave, plus thickness at bottom. Add offset roof slab behind? Could add a back slope going up-right. Hmm.

Simplify: keep front gable roof, add depth layer at right (a parallelogram from right eave top to offset). It will suggest depth.

Trees: draw shadow, trunk, 3 canopy circles with highlights. Already okay but tiny. Increase canopy to 26 and vary.

Add fountain animation ripples, chimney smoke, NPC name tags when nearby, player name.

Add crop plot with little plants, fence posts.

Also the world is 1100x700 drawn to fit; on mobile will shrink a lot. We have tap to move. For mobile, UI side overlay width 178 etc.

Let's patch drawBuilding and drawTree, plus add decorative details (lanterns, fountain, bushes, grass tufts). Also add a compass/legend.

Important: current people are drawn with emoji over a circle, making weird. Could draw stylized characters instead: body cloak, head, hair, small arms. Emoji at 10px is unreadable. Replace with vector people with different color cloaks and hair, and name only when nearby. Let's do that.

Player vector too, with cloak color gold and a little satchel. Good.

Let's rewrite functions.

I'll use python replace for whole drawBuilding function line and drawTree line and the people loop.

Find exact strings from file.

